@startuml
title ATM State Machine Diagram

state "Idle" as Idle
state "Waiting for Card" as WaitingForCard
state "Validating PIN" as ValidatingPIN
state "Displaying Options" as DisplayingOptions
state "Processing Request" as ProcessingRequest
state "Confiscating" as Confiscating

[*] --> Idle

Idle --> WaitingForCard : Card Inserted / Get PIN

WaitingForCard --> ValidatingPIN : PIN Entered / Validate PIN
ValidatingPIN --> WaitingForCard : Invalid PIN / Invalid PIN Prompt
ValidatingPIN --> DisplayingOptions : Valid PIN / Display Menu
ValidatingPIN --> Confiscating : Third Invalid PIN, Card Stolen, Card Expired / Confiscate

DisplayingOptions --> ProcessingRequest : Select Option / Process Request
ProcessingRequest --> WaitingForCard : Cancel Operation / Return Card

Confiscating --> [*] : Card Confiscated

@enduml
